  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e49bbc76ff0b9721c4fce49a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "双人同步好难啊~！\r\n但是，只有做到这一点，\r\n才能超越会长。要加油喽——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c14d142c71c34ece894d376d5922e774ff783273c8a48ede413de2abcd546a8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37c33614c4a76280f6eda1d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚强有志！鹤丸刚志！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99698f8c6854bdf6d6edec53e4957ce2b7ec91af5996fd4cfc510387c15eae60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1212edd6d5075da633b8d92e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完成啦……哈……哈……\r\n累、累死了……哈……不过……嘿嘿，\r\n我完成任务了哦，会长……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c235d1d91b698dcb864f5120446aec70668838ddbf3a2063be9d79e4da366da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5021281bcc02db9eb1b1487b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "燃起来了啊~~~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61fe90f16f46cf185e0c9ed8dcc72062200956df65a4211efa368b20cdf4012c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "40002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28b5b225cbbb8f5b2e48fc2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "~~♪……嗯，没有咳嗽！\r\n看来能尽情唱了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b042e7fc199f9eacedf0c73f8f8ed70952d93e0019ff8dd3bcf17266f1c8bc46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2485297662f57bb6857a799f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉没什么问题，\r\n可以全力踏出步伐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c4de97c73384248a3a5571df4edd2ced24dd5bb366ea38e3dd3af41ebbd09e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57da93bc9cadcfed69ccde92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会尽全力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70a9dc51bbeb3b70a182f0df16ce1bb26c65e45485b00ae98c6eec0b87194bc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e900a8e5429264122621d4a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因为遇见了你，我才会\r\n更加坚定地不想放弃努力，\r\n想去变得更强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c238b0d24b010e9e5c9d051a3c51b70033c07de59c9f5d31872753ac503158d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60251afa7843179b278fbd38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种不易起皱的面料\r\n真是帮大忙了~！\r\n毕竟我经常摔倒……啊哈哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd2b62c716ae462826eb2b59fa6bf38ca07838d8b06e76e9af435e7e3f9752ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:097831753b7b8bbe5c8aedac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小帝王直传之技，『刚志舞步』！\r\n就让你见识一下吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3561d1710741e0938c393225c8bd4c9cac848ca472d9320ec0f99160b5281c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8fd3308be38abc9c7050d39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚志是强大的孩子，\r\n是元气的孩子！这样的信念\r\n比任何事都重要！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b23a550adb2932ce156dcb64786964816701b715a4d1faba3eb85a4c047a405",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29a00c510bc47d68e4aa643d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和尊敬的前辈和朋友\r\n穿同样的制服什么的，\r\n真让人紧张啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a8f220b0265581ed4dafc2357feb5ce9e49fa58c1973b007c67fcec940fc6e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:870d6bebf93a30194885af9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞台的照明时不时会让人\r\n感到眩晕……不过我会想办法\r\n忍受住的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "213c339c9a6a55ce2fe661e4b0a8a709f54a592d280e07a01c4b595d24dae61d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7a79a095e6e6aea30554a72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "斗志已经在熊熊燃烧了！\r\n好——勒！赶紧奔跑起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0201361ccebde37c370510ef04394dcc880fe1b77d6f063353735235db37a658",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdaf0c621d386cf033499ab3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种的也不错呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff9e66d1154829eeaf74488edb2953b4386f9ef0c9a9e04cbb4c7f8c3b32fc61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2e8b2add4c35f2379802041",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也不知道合不合适？\r\n看起来怎么样呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "46c7219c1c92f98f26bd238d379d0a0bcd3ddce4ef643a649b8ad80b0c147c6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff6d6b38d5f47327a510a3be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动方便的穿着，很让人安心呢。\n摔倒了也能及时采取防御措施！",
      "source_fingerprint": "994f8aef9cbb1ddd4d92ec7dbd37902e56afc91c95cfdb80dd6f836035735a0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c377c0006a444b46c38c2236",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去散散步吧。\n顺便去一下药店……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef0dcefe73100f8ef677cd9c2e685d967c00d4a1d6729947ef203606d6b84713",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79a893424e93ff73ca5fc59f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种不易起皱的面料\r\n真是帮大忙了~！\r\n毕竟我经常摔倒……啊哈哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd2b62c716ae462826eb2b59fa6bf38ca07838d8b06e76e9af435e7e3f9752ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b25c21f7457cedee76820ce4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小帝王直传之技，『刚志舞步』！\r\n就让你见识一下吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3561d1710741e0938c393225c8bd4c9cac848ca472d9320ec0f99160b5281c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
