      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9680a53aa61a5bca3dc8958f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "斗志已经在熊熊燃烧了！\r\n好——勒！赶紧奔跑起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0201361ccebde37c370510ef04394dcc880fe1b77d6f063353735235db37a658",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:096b348ae8ebc829f58db538",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种的也不错呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff9e66d1154829eeaf74488edb2953b4386f9ef0c9a9e04cbb4c7f8c3b32fc61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c48cd82a0af675dd40ad300",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也不知道合不合适？\r\n看起来怎么样呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "46c7219c1c92f98f26bd238d379d0a0bcd3ddce4ef643a649b8ad80b0c147c6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c91af325d94182a47e494cfd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20df094ff1112517c623c111a7239f2b6398134743fb570a85aa6a2f9f1f8889",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:252dd2f8884868c153e3d4da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好！\r\n今天早上也做了锻炼，\r\n所以现在很清醒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7509725d8f0348b7804ffe2f219ab13c345422aaa6207a09e3edf33882a4b0d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c74980975a30ac98fc8f6700",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说……早上喝白开水对身体好\r\n就试了一下，结果有点太烫了\r\n舌头还……嘶，好烫。",
      "source_fingerprint": "185aa3bd2dae3a78aa7901d4b7db68058581cb0bc61cb59b3c0045f6240bb4af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc99664389b9242a9e7c70a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃了好多好多饭，还吃了\r\n好多好多的菜，现在营养满满，\r\n浑身是劲！……唔嗝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0f2333e755aa820dce7116d6b6a9707a915682b37563f67853ea6b987376e08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:273bebae57e060c6bffdf34c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "中午反而容易睡着呢……\r\n干脆以后就以午睡为主好了\r\n啊不行不行！得正确努力才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49a87984ab9e0a80e8e7e068599e7d4556a3853f5c00506bcdeacdac6c488627",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e3c89505ebde69c177bd1b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天也要早起晨练……\r\n啊，当然也得好好保证睡眠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5042d161585cc09447effd30050083b2d21314808fd9ef8b844fd1028c01d9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:159704fbdc515166e6ddb9d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妹妹该给我发LANE了——正想着\r\n弟弟也发来了！欸嘿嘿，\r\n今天会发来什么呢~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ffb2e29d343e7f39e67da562f8f68f0fe7bf7e805709b80fe90f946179cb3cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94c93e9dcb05745377668284",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸溜……训练员，\r\n要小心花粉过敏哦……真的真的\r\n会很难受的……吸溜溜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e0d057440ffd94d43b48c776f859a7802fca4ab7431b88dd500748a8c0d120e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79f4e3eb36318bf9f2726aa1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真想给发明空调的人发个大奖啊……\r\n如果没有空调，我现在会是\r\n什么样子呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74ad04b11c820a44a1771f740c430f31410511634ea4f90a5cc6430fd5c65ddf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ac3ec901f802cde7eb25cd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在是有着很多大型比赛，\r\n让人精神紧绷的时期呢。\r\n……嗯，我也要加油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dff423c1390ff55e06d4cd036e04f8a69eced8e2741c9536b4afae74ca69dfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:690c157908181dfd31849fcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "会下雪吗~？小的时候只能\r\n从房间里看到，要是能\r\n触碰到的话会很让人开心呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "42fda65950276d6b0d47b2eb1e00df8b1a811014cd5bc614ba141d12a7dc6916",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c893bd9d9c07a7503a3d595",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0d86434755b7b6bf8a3358b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『道路拥堵，忒毒忒堵』……\r\n欸嘿嘿，这是新想的冷笑话。\r\n希望能让会长开心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90eae0f368a65f77cda39f2903a88e1f055f1f5e85a6deae7033edabc8f51efc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c92cf105d15de7462d511019",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚志，参上——咳咳，\r\n咳咳！！小鹰教给我的\r\n招牌台词，真难啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fedfaf696349e945c10794c460e93228d02f54538c8fc60750638904f4678999",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:538acc9685bafa3b72522c23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "经常去保健室的我能勉强跟上学习，\r\n都是多亏了小草老师。\r\n真是太感谢了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4533d0759183b45da478b3d21970bbc9f011480e39b82dcc90b7081b17a67ebc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea8d040da4e0fe4c2cb5f730",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "校门边上发现了一只小猫咪！\r\n拍张照片发给小青的话。\r\n她应该会很开心吧？欸嘿嘿嘿♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c802756f0a261a24f7ca30ee7bb2e13edc58766e79c83b8c1e090484b357426",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7935fb220026eb01898e7b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣・王！圣・王！！\r\n今天也要干劲十足地\r\n让小圣王露出笑容~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeda8dc16efd76cd476e86e860f23efa7427a9a8907beec34e10aa3524b9e929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28a6fa37fab184ad38ec3e55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跳舞我还是有些自信的！\r\n毕竟小帝王有好好教过我了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "739608d811f4aef519f9cd84fbfb063fa3d71aa1c4feb9cb772b5b182a8970f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:804c9ee4f744467ce419afa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在舞台上绝对要注意不能倒下。\r\n那么快乐的氛围，\r\n可不能给破坏了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "edd64fb5988dad924e7374862c6ed2e2ce9329f0380309fea52bb8e38b412aca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1c67c658aa28191e57e7e69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比任何人都帅气的鹤丸刚志！\r\n是终将制霸三冠的强力赛马娘！\r\n……我看起来有这种感觉吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "74bc1525aa26653ae6288a768c1a7a863da3079bea8c4be67c0086085c289b6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0719739ea93097bf3fd7fd37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "注意到了吗？没错，\r\n左袖是重点！穿着这件衣服的我\r\n可是很『强』的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85dfefc25ae35b4c60be4d7e31d7e30a2b3604eead896e69ef4f83d678bd2a89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52252cf7af092211b28360e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员早上习惯吃面包还是米饭？\r\n我是米饭派的。面包怎么都\r\n很难消化呢~……啊哈哈……",
      "source_fingerprint": "257783f395d4e8ee90bc37e431305b0bb0c3df136e4434678d465f68d4064dff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:193df19f6b27af1effe1ea01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "手工做的香蕉蛋糕让小特很开心♪\r\n想不到她全都吃光光了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5696ede88ca543285e1829c2690993c8b597a65c8bcd2cb6e5015c2d164e4968",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ef3906b03da0e5099b38d8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和光明学姐说话会让人感到治愈\r\n变得能安然入睡呢。\r\n她是我最棒的室友。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4186fb23bf6c2c09b718e0f5dd3e156b76303373223b74d4eb541b10501f0906",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d79ba6d680dffdd2892d3e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『谢谢您为我带路！』，\r\n像这样被新生用闪亮亮的眼神\r\n表达感谢……！好、好开心~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d474472e11c9eaf19e906a5f0c62facbbd98b9885941e0b9e8899662f311f574",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e204d4d502d11938e764ccd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "台风、大雨、气压变化……唔……\r\n没问题，不会输的，不会输的，\r\n不会输的~~……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "494b83c6b800f1eb607bb4196a1106ca6c67829e16b58e467ab99a99ac087c8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:739cb3a3f98a84bd1aa442e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏乏一结束，秋盹又来了……\r\n唔……脑袋昏沉沉的~~……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcfa6208e46c2c048cb3c889f4cc58f46786ea8906729a2e782d3171042e775c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09ec35c935325f7365ae8721",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对了，需要暖宝宝吗？\r\n我带了很多，\r\n要多少都行随便拿~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90344525a58509481fff6a2b5632b89546017d68558d5b7c66c91b9beb8fa4f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e174f74d5daddff773118b8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也请多多指教！\r\n我会用正确方法全力以赴的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "636eaaed1a61e4a48af2c8d5297df880bc414de45d76e398b839823280bb830d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f35726dea47d1cf9f8a88af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "004e7ad03760ca4de54eb8714ebf3d626f0737fd957dec00e92601dd4fdc23ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68203b7ae0c64162e2e40cb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "首先要深呼吸……\r\n嘶~~哈~~——\r\n咳咳！咳咳咳！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0beb34e39f7d78f299d2acd89029dc636e9484db4520dc8ae6cf5fe8d1068228",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e2407995063581db8b1da65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "越努力就越能不断变强！\r\n呜哦，要燃起来了~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb50b595696e64a16ccb8f3993764838fadb573298cafa3f8ae941c6b12212b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77606915a98bc1bd2c285f8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用担心！\r\n氧气喷雾和运动胶带\r\n都准备得很充足。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cd50ed338d321c3484bbee7237e0592b2d4f9839df786ea96c86afd369f60ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e22d70753157eecf5f8fc126",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了成为鲁道夫会长那样的\r\n三冠赛马娘！\r\n我要比任何人都更努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1a2fe3f5cb0bb42ebe9cd0a28cc846e2c900aba15dce2fdfd651f25d6b02f2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:335e8b2c1f1ca225bed3ae02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让大家担心了，\r\n不过我完全还能努力！……嘿嘿，\r\n不用说也能明白的，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "81d2ced3a953dc3575c5d7952ff555440bb010be242f72f105a92cd3c743282a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd1c026a98bc988d4cb35310",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实我今天起的有点太早……\r\n——诶，训练员也是吗！？\r\n看来我们都得注意一下呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f9691dbe5426799b5f307efdc12f32f47489acd30137d371d9c369be9c6a69f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6993802abf72e834e595d004",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耀眼的太阳！猛烈的热意！\r\n看来能完成最棒的训练呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fbade65d351469a49d14984261c6200e96238ad38498b01aeaecd5ce5e30bcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe8b604db2bc0ee68e10ebdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏了你，我才能变得精神闪耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd47a98313f78b66c54fd2a996f2a0450755f0ca189021209896659cecf8ffd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddf146934583f3d6faeecd35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力以赴，竭尽所能，我做到啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88f61acf97c851c020de2bc0147e87013282dfc18c1642f81351b39831e7d76b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:774573bfc2b459cd5988b39c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要成为更强的刚志！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03cc32e6971fd90a1e9e655cef214f90ed05c0cbf674a25448a46b2fac0aa8ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b171acf5c5da2c3cf094f06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要不放弃就什么都能做到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "370629be8125326ce385acdb865417ea5c574ae649b3b37d7da96e68c3c99cb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b601449f15e11d63d2429dca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鹤丸刚志，\r\n会加油的——咳咳！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32d0b7193fe3abd87962d9b5a3a7ac13c55229ca287df07a26161cb3fedf53ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5aa8350273d42108c4e25a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还能发挥更多力量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e15f811ce657a3d4f764c6d28d3a80c8b03689cdcd3307eb2541d55daeddc81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68024e02fdcc1f5d57928344",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看我的全力支援吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96124cdb079cbf4890f8b9647b8b0b87e46c2cda3c098d1289da20155464e87b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da68fe416e13e10738eb04ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上场了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb01a590e1da97082479caaa8d69650d99bc78276106830b2805651212c04f17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57b59a78bf3f276a1368261a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耐心等着新芽萌发吧。\r\n我们有足够的实力\r\n容许我们不慌不忙地等待～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcfc1f0a3699950373d6cc8964621e0d792b21fe4d5b16c7b25fc5149b6ab3d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e5f7286b5ce4cd7a4cbce09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行って参ります～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70663e5396e165a1176c0697689ea06022298bdbab4f2237e467b4572216c12a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af44904dce8e8884c4c4a322",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戻りましたわ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c88afe54f76e6ff6e0a5c64a83947a2a8927ea95bb82eb578996ad89f6aff108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cc1e0d94132adddca3187cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要有训练员在，无论冬天\r\n有多寒冷……我们都能一起\r\n等待春天来临呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "df7ab53be3cbb4d84388e2a6d5339a1e700bcacdacff7d359851c97f87b8a95b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f728d5bfd5ff31588519390e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们只要维持属于自己的步调\r\n就好了呢～不须着急，\r\n坚持我们两人的作风……",
      "source_fingerprint": "151b16722b0282fde37bc335b63cceccbd5f6256fd778794bf18a8275fcf69e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ce1ec2d6815b2b68b02627b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向你说声新年快乐～\r\n今年的目标嘛……嗯～\r\n夏天来临前我会决定好的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef08e0ea8e4d7c62a2c2ea12669938915d0369c5bce646fec6d00e9e339b4fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1244cfeb347ecc5d58e0819c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请稍等一下喔～\r\n我记得我把巧克力……\r\n哎呀？难道忘在教室里了～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "21fbd02af5d40a4f234720ae4d7d28a94493c9b00a5c9dc75185b7d2fb20b6de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:917f3f022fb675efee3bf6a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天我可是做好了\r\n万全的事前准备喔？\r\n毕竟今天可是情人节呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d45b579b9bfacfee9d59c1893c8e89aa962f0b75acc4dac291d4754b7bb6c1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5801722c586d61abc5b12548",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想好七夕愿望了吗？\r\n我呢……希望自己能赶在\r\n今天结束前挂上短签～",
      "source_fingerprint": "19ad722bf10c8f3ca930099bf47602c8691886ad5e1a9230c49ec008d36e762a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10006"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
